          .g-shot.s6
            i(style="grid-column:span 3")
            i.r(style="grid-column:5/span 8;grid-row:1/span 2")
            i(style="grid-column:span 3")
            i(style="grid-column:span 3")
            i.r(style="grid-column:5/span 5;grid-row:3/span 2")
            i.r(style="grid-column:11/span 2;grid-row:3/span 2")
            i(style="grid-column:span 3")
          .g-meta
            .g-name
              .g-id rail
              .g-title 側欄
            .g-desc 把四個數字立起來。左邊一整欄是指標, 右邊一張主圖佔掉其餘的全部; 一個紅、其餘全是灰階。
